<title>JAPAN: Kawai Musical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kawai Musical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 42.24		vs	   44.21</p>
<p> Operating   loss 227    million	  vs   loss 457    million</p>
<p> Current	loss 68    million	  vs   loss 425    million</p>
<p> Net		 prft 22 million	  vs   loss 705    million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 0.31 yen	  vs     loss 9.81 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     72 million	  vs	  72 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kawai Musical Instruments Mfg Co Ltd is a large musical instrument maker.</p>
